@startuml
title Join an online class | FR-011 | BR-039–041
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam ArrowColor #475569
skinparam activityBackgroundColor #F1F5F9
skinparam activityBorderColor #475569
skinparam sequenceParticipantBackgroundColor #F1F5F9
skinparam sequenceParticipantBorderColor #475569
skinparam stateBackgroundColor #F1F5F9
skinparam stateBorderColor #475569
actor "Learner or Teacher" as U
participant SkillSwap as S
participant "Classroom invitation service" as I
participant "Online classroom (Jitsi)" as J
U -> S: Ask to join the booked class
S -> S: Find the booking and class
S -> S: Check participant identity, confirmed booking\nand allowed joining time
alt Person is not allowed to join
 S --> U: Refuse access and explain why
else Person is allowed to join
 S -> I: Prepare a private invitation for this class and person
 alt Invitation cannot be prepared
  S -> S: Record the problem for support
  S --> U: Room access is temporarily unavailable
 else Invitation is ready
  I --> S: Temporary invitation and expiry time
  S --> U: Room link and private invitation
  U -> J: Enter the classroom using the invitation
 end
end
note over S,J: Default joining time: 15 minutes before class until scheduled end.\nSkillSwap prepares access locally; joining does not create a room through a separate request.
@enduml
